  "type": "ImplementationProfile",
  "prefLabel": "Intersects",
  "definition": "Implementation Profile of the operation Intersects, whose meaning is its activity type (activityType): the signature of the Generic Profile Binary spatial predicate, bound to data exchange formats.",
  "inScheme": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile",
  "hasAction": [
    {
      "id": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/intersects/actions/addition",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "addition",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-09-30T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/intersects"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/intersects/actions/meaning-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/activity-type/intersects, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"Returns TRUE if this geometric object spatially intersects anotherGeometry (i.e. they share at least one point). Equivalent to the negation of Disjoint.\"",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/intersects"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/intersects/actions/operation-sources-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "The keyword ST_Intersects becomes an altLabel of the activity type; the sources defining the operation move to the activity type: OGC 06-103r4 Simple Feature Access - Part 1: Common Architecture, \u00a76.1.15; ISO/IEC 13249-3:2016 Information technology -- Database languages -- SQL multimedia and application packages -- Part 3: Spatial, \u00a75.1.24 ST_Intersects; the illustration of the operation moves to the activity type.",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/intersects"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/intersects/actions/representation-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The schema copied on each input and output that had one is replaced by the representation that realizes its data type in the data-formats register (decision D6): inputs/geometry1 -> geometry-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"}); inputs/geometry2 -> geometry-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"}).",
      "proposer": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/intersects"
    }
  ],
